  "details": "It's not constant. It comes and goes but it can be dangerous for some users such as those with epilepsy. Every now and then I will get a flickering bright multi-coloured light that is hard to look at. It only happens with transparent materials such as ones on avatars or in worlds for windows. The bug used to be different where it would actually be inverted colours to what we see now in the clip I am providing but that was a long time ago.\n\nMy PC specs:\n\nRyzen 5 3600\n\n32GB Ram\n\nRX 6700 XT\n\nMy drivers are all up to date and I have reinstalled them many times. This has been going on for about a year for me but I only got a clip of it happening now. I recently did a clean install of windows and that didn't even fix the issue (this wasn't the reason I did it but I still thought it might just happen to fix it). I hop this post helps in some way.",
